# ==============================================================================
# Large Datasets & Archives
# (Protects against accidental commits of full multi-gigabyte climate datasets)
# The smoke-test fixtures (data/CORDEX_NZ_sample, data/CORDEX_NZ_adapter_test)
# are synthetic and regenerated by tests/run_smoke_tests.py, so all of data/ is ignored.
# ==============================================================================
data/
# Trained model weights (~130 MB per BGNet); regenerated by the runners
checkpoints/
*.weights.h5
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.nc
